+// The predicate reads BOTH shapes deliberately: a raw parsed .claudinite-checks.json
+// and the normalized config loadConfig returns — the enforcer's sweeps read another
+// repo's declaration over the API with no engine on hand, and they must decide
+// dormancy by the same test the repo's own scheduler used. One definition, both
+// sides of the fleet.
